WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.999 --> 00:00:06.020
Hey youtubers it’s Charlie and this week
for my continuing exploration of the Marvel-Verse

00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:08.610
I thought it would be fun to talk about the
Doctor Strange Movie that will be happening

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:09.610
during phase 3.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.040
It hasn’t been officially announced, but
behind every rumor there is a little truth

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:15.450
and Marvel is meeting almost every major actor
in Hollywood for the role.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:18.660
At least every major actor that can convincingly
pull off a trippy magic based movie.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:23.790
So in this video I’ll list my top 5 stories
I think would make a good first movie for

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:28.340
the character and then I’ll talk about some
of the actor rumors.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.410
If you’re finding me for the first time
I’m trying to do one big Marvel Movie video

00:00:31.410 --> 00:00:34.300
every Tuesday in addition to my Agents of
SHIELD videos.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.550
Be sure to subscribe and join in on the fun.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.400
So top 5 Doctor Strange stories.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.750
Number 5 - Essential Doctor Strange volume
1.

00:00:41.750 --> 00:00:46.280
This is the collected works of Stan Lee and
Steve Ditko’s original run on the character.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:48.350
The original origin story.

00:00:48.350 --> 00:00:51.710
Expect to see a Stan Lee Cameo in the movie
and at least some easter eggs if not straight

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.390
up lines from characters.

00:00:54.390 --> 00:00:58.460
Because this was written in the early 60s
it became a benchmark for weird.

00:00:58.460 --> 00:01:03.230
And right now I think the Guardians of The
Galaxy is doing that for superhero movies.

00:01:03.230 --> 00:01:08.280
Almost every subsequent re-telling of the
origin story borrows aspects of Stan Lee’s

00:01:08.280 --> 00:01:09.280
original.

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.860
So the movie will at least pay homage to these
stories.

00:01:11.860 --> 00:01:16.790
One notable change I expect to see would be
using shortening the long prose speeches.

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:21.970
Stan Lee likes to talk a lot, and Stan Lee’s
Doctor Strange consequently talked a lot.

00:01:21.970 --> 00:01:27.119
So yes, expect any movie version of the character
to speechify more than the Hulk and a slightly

00:01:27.119 --> 00:01:28.960
less than chatty Tony Stark.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:30.670
Number 4 - Triumph and Torment.

00:01:30.670 --> 00:01:34.650
This would have to be changed a little bit,
but it involves Doctor Strange getting Doctor

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:37.290
Doom’s help to rescue Doom’s mother from
Mephisto.

00:01:37.290 --> 00:01:42.409
It’s done by Hellboy’s Mike Mignola and
reads like super high drama romance Downton

00:01:42.409 --> 00:01:46.840
Abbey style crossed with a dream you could
only have if you were really high.

00:01:46.840 --> 00:01:50.840
What premise could be cooler than Doctor Strange
and Doctor Doom go to hell.

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:54.880
Mephisto like Dormammu is a really big villain.

00:01:54.880 --> 00:01:58.030
So I’ll be curious if they keep those types
of characters in the movie.

00:01:58.030 --> 00:02:00.810
They cut Mandarin out of the original Iron
Man movie.

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:06.549
Due to copyright they’d have to swap Doctor
Doom for another character.

00:02:06.549 --> 00:02:08.879
Number 3 - A Separate Reality.

00:02:08.879 --> 00:02:10.990
Most people refer to this as Frank Brunner’s
Run.

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:12.100
He was the artist.

00:02:12.100 --> 00:02:13.100
Not the writer.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:17.430
I would put it up with Bryan K Vaugahn’
run, which would come later.

00:02:17.430 --> 00:02:21.201
The story is an excellent blend of a lot of
the science fiction aspects of the marvel

00:02:21.201 --> 00:02:23.980
universe and the fantasy elements of magic.

00:02:23.980 --> 00:02:27.930
Strange ends up fighting this other Sorceror
trying to become god and it really reminds

00:02:27.930 --> 00:02:32.510
me of the original Infinity Gauntlet storyline
where a villain tries to achieve ultimate

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:37.030
power so that he can fill a hole inside himself,
replace something that’s missing.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:38.290
Like hugs.

00:02:38.290 --> 00:02:40.360
And ultimately it turns into a story about
redemption.

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:45.379
For all you anime fans out there it also really
reminded me of fullmetal alchemist brotherhood.

00:02:45.379 --> 00:02:49.459
It’s stories like this that make me really
excited to see how an enlightened being like

00:02:49.459 --> 00:02:52.769
Strange is going to deal with the man of pure
science like Tony Stark.

00:02:52.769 --> 00:02:56.371
But that’s really the job of whoever ends
up writing the script.

00:02:56.371 --> 00:02:58.069
Making Fantasy blend well with Science Fiction.

00:02:58.069 --> 00:03:01.190
Kind of like the original Star Wars Trilogy.Which
Disney also happens to own.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:03.180
Number 2 - The Flight of Bones.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:07.510
This was part of the great noir Marvel Knights
miniseries era and invoked this really cool

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:11.060
detective story setting Doctor Strange after
Dormammu.

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:14.739
Think of it as being like Doctor Strange written
like Sherlock Holmes.

00:03:14.739 --> 00:03:17.570
Number 1 - The Oath by Bryan K Vaughan (or
New Avengers) - has to lead into AV3/Infinity.

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:21.909
This was an amazing re-telling of the origin
story that solved the really problematic aspects

00:03:21.909 --> 00:03:26.560
of magic by not making them the focus of the
story.

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:30.810
It also does a great job of balancing the
more philosophical aspects of wielding limitless

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.659
power with the fun magical battles in other
dimensions.

00:03:33.659 --> 00:03:39.739
The big issue with a Doctor Strange story
that’s different from say Captain America

00:03:39.739 --> 00:03:41.519
is that he can’t punch his problems away.

00:03:41.519 --> 00:03:44.450
And he has to balance really dark power and
white magic.

00:03:44.450 --> 00:03:49.160
Since this would all help lead into the more
magical aspects of the infinity gems, Thanos

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:54.580
and the infinity gauntlet in phase 3.

00:03:54.580 --> 00:03:59.430
You should also check out Doctor Strange’s
recent appearances in New Avengers.

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:04.980
It’s essentially an illuminati story, so
I could totally see them using it as inspiration

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:08.590
for how all these new different heroes come
together in outer space.

00:04:08.590 --> 00:04:13.010
Now it’s your turn though, let me know which
Doctor Strange origin story you think they’ll

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:19.910
use and how they’ll change it to make it
more modern.

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:26.979
Just to address the Johnny Depp rumors, he
had a meeting a long long time ago before

00:04:26.979 --> 00:04:31.590
Marvel ever created their unified movie universe
and phases.

00:04:31.590 --> 00:04:35.009
So if they do get a big actor, it will be
someone else.

00:04:35.009 --> 00:04:36.970
We can always talk about that in another video.

00:04:36.970 --> 00:04:40.160
I’ve been doing a lot of phase 3 videos,
and there are still a few other films we could

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:43.910
talk about like the Black Widow movie they’re
working on or Black Panther.

00:04:43.910 --> 00:04:46.080
Or more Guardians of The Galaxy.

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:49.151
Let me know whether you want to talk about
another movie next week or if you want to

00:04:49.151 --> 00:04:53.840
talk about actors or something else all together.

00:04:53.840 --> 00:04:58.010
Right now click here to learn all about my
top 5 picks for the Captain America 3 story

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:01.300
and click here for my character breakdown
of Guardians of The Galaxy.

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:03.229
Thanks for watching, see you guys tomorrow.

00:05:03.229 --> 00:05:03.779
High Fives!

